        "created_at": "2021-03-23T14:51:41.524Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It was ALL ACCORDING TO PLAN!!!<br>\nAdvanced Bomber Blade’s plan to distract and confuse The Harpy, Mainstay, Captain Cosmic, and Lifeline seems to have worked, as now there are ACTUALLY bombs at the Court of Blood! Captain Cosmic seems to have a bit of a queasy stomach though. He’s turned green! (CC Requital now)</p>\n<p>Good luck heroes!</p>",
