        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Mint with most ~15, though Mainstay was low due to a Headlock.\n\nAdvanced Mad Bomber Blade means he adds more cards under his card at the end of his turn / Plays the top card of his deck, so you want to flip him real fast. Otherwise you're looking at 5 damage round 2, and upwards of 7 round 3. Owch.\n\nGood thing this team can do some major damage, especially with Unhallowed Halls upping the infernal damage. Flipped him before round 3, and once there CC tanked his death ray with his Cosmic Crest. He got a Living Force Field out, so Mainstay Headlock'ed him. Unfortunately, his next play was Backlash Field, so he started taking major damage. Managed to bring down Blade before Mainstay, and it was all good.\n\n~A-Kat",
